      "writtenOn": "2018-10-26T19:07:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well, actually CONFIG_IPC_NS depends on (SYSV_IPC || POSIX_MQUEUE) and we have some kernels where CONFIG_IPC_NS is enabled (along with POSIX_MQUEUE of course). If we do it, I think we\u0027d want to allow binder to be used w/o namespaces if !CONFIG_IPC_NS.\n\nThis topic has been coming up quite a bit lately and will have some discussion at LPC this month.\n\npmalani@, are you still interested in this? Are you going to LPC?",
