        "id": 1060196
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-09-11T18:22:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thinking about this a bit more (and discussing with team mates), I don\u0027t think debugFS in general is properly namespaced (newly spawned containers don\u0027t have their own debugFS by default), so I think it may be best (initially) to just dump all proc binder data for all namespaces. \n\nIn a follow up CL, I can modify this to organize it by namespace.",
      "parentUuid": "fe08ebf7_3ef23dd3",
